    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the nose wheel steering actuation manifold and its accumulator, covering the built-up manifold and the standard 3 machined block on separate sheets.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the steering manifold, the accumulator, the filter element and the position sensing hardware in the nose gear bay, for both manifold standards.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the built-up manifold with the external accumulator hose and the four fittings it needs; sheet 2 shows the standard 3 machined block with the accumulator on a face port and no external hose. Pipe end fittings differ between the two sheets and must not be mixed, because a cross-fitted joint will pass a static leak check and fail under pressure. The filter element is common to both standards but sits in a different cavity."
    },
